{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gas Pump Simulator is a Co-Op Gas Station Simulator!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or in Co-Op for up to 6 people. Join other players' games and run a gas station together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660740/extras/98c73135cc9381647dd4f12b2902fbc8.poster.avif?t=1756212263\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660740/extras/98c73135cc9381647dd4f12b2902fbc8.webm?t=1756212263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660740/extras/98c73135cc9381647dd4f12b2902fbc8.mp4?t=1756212263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Start with a single gas pump and become successful</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a run-down office and a single gas pump. Provide the best service to a few cars that come to get gas at first. Reach hundreds of cars daily.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660740/extras/17e0744178d9f8c567a09eda01af5b63.poster.avif?t=1756212263\" aria-label=\"Start with a run-down office and a single gas pump. Provide the best service to a few cars that come to get gas at first. Reach hundreds of cars daily.\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660740/extras/17e0744178d9f8c567a09eda01af5b63.webm?t=1756212263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660740/extras/17e0744178d9f8c567a09eda01af5b63.mp4?t=1756212263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The best service is provided by teamwork</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660740/extras/78de4aa66998c5730d9e41e7b676b0d3.poster.avif?t=1756212263\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660740/extras/78de4aa66998c5730d9e41e7b676b0d3.webm?t=1756212263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660740/extras/78de4aa66998c5730d9e41e7b676b0d3.mp4?t=1756212263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More gas pumps means more money</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your station with improvements. More gas pumps mean more cars can be fueled.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expand your Gas Station, offer new services</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new toilet for your customers, a car wash or maybe even a car repair... The more services you offer, the more successful you will be.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More employees for good service</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave the work to the employees and watch your gas station grow.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Track your stock</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marketplace customers are constantly requesting different products. You must place new orders and keep your stocks up to date.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Play Co-Op with up to 6 players. Build a gas station together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Build and manage an advanced gas station from a single gas pump.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Offer services such as Car Wash, Car Repair, Market and Toilet to your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Expand your gas station and improve it with new features.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3660740?t=1756212263","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660740/0f06080528e5475f2438a018b75cff95cac9b162/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756212263","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660740/0deeb639731093e516eb12ab7adb9c8bf2036498/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756212263","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660740/0deeb639731093e516eb12ab7adb9c8bf2036498/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756212263","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gas Pump Simulator is a Co-Op Gas Station Simulator!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or in Co-Op for up to 6 people. Join other players' games and run a gas station together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660740/extras/98c73135cc9381647dd4f12b2902fbc8.poster.avif?t=1756212263\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660740/extras/98c73135cc9381647dd4f12b2902fbc8.webm?t=1756212263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660740/extras/98c73135cc9381647dd4f12b2902fbc8.mp4?t=1756212263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Start with a single gas pump and become successful</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a run-down office and a single gas pump. Provide the best service to a few cars that come to get gas at first. Reach hundreds of cars daily.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660740/extras/17e0744178d9f8c567a09eda01af5b63.poster.avif?t=1756212263\" aria-label=\"Start with a run-down office and a single gas pump. Provide the best service to a few cars that come to get gas at first. Reach hundreds of cars daily.\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660740/extras/17e0744178d9f8c567a09eda01af5b63.webm?t=1756212263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660740/extras/17e0744178d9f8c567a09eda01af5b63.mp4?t=1756212263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The best service is provided by teamwork</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660740/extras/78de4aa66998c5730d9e41e7b676b0d3.poster.avif?t=1756212263\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660740/extras/78de4aa66998c5730d9e41e7b676b0d3.webm?t=1756212263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660740/extras/78de4aa66998c5730d9e41e7b676b0d3.mp4?t=1756212263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More gas pumps means more money</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your station with improvements. More gas pumps mean more cars can be fueled.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expand your Gas Station, offer new services</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new toilet for your customers, a car wash or maybe even a car repair... The more services you offer, the more successful you will be.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More employees for good service</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave the work to the employees and watch your gas station grow.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Track your stock</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marketplace customers are constantly requesting different products. You must place new orders and keep your stocks up to date.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Play Co-Op with up to 6 players. Build a gas station together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Build and manage an advanced gas station from a single gas pump.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Offer services such as Car Wash, Car Repair, Market and Toilet to your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Expand your gas station and improve it with new features.</p>","developers":["2Medya"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3660740/85d4e4353fd9901740cd9148166abe80356d1487/header.jpg?t=1756212263","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257188176,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257188176/movie480.mp4?t=1756116111","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257188176/movie_max.mp4?t=1756116111"},"name":"Gas Pump Simulator Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/